@namespace DotNetNuke.Common.Controls
@inherits DotNetNuke.Entities.Modules.PortalModuleBase

@using System
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components

@*
    Replaces nocontent.ascx + NoContent.ascx.cs + NoContent.ascx.designer.cs.

    The original .ascx carried ONLY its @@Control directive: the control deliberately renders
    nothing. It is the module control DNN loads for a module instance whose content must not be
    emitted, so an empty render tree is the correct and complete behaviour - there is no markup,
    no code-behind logic (OnInit only called an empty InitializeComponent) and no designer field to
    port.

    The file is named NoContent.razor because a component file may not start with a lowercase letter
    (RZ10011); the TYPE name and namespace are unchanged (DotNetNuke.Common.Controls.NoContent).
*@
